-server-fast-access-to-linkage-information-on-the-web/"}, {"title": "Web browsing", "url": "https://cs.brown.edu/people/orgs/artemis/old/2001/lessons/Web-browsing.pdf"}, {"title": "making connections on the web", "url": "https://www.npr.org/2003/08/12/1393621/making-connections-on-the-web"}, {"title": "Web search integration guides", "url": "https://docs.retool.com/4.0/data-sources/guides/integrations/websearch/"}, {"title": "0% found this document useful (0 votes)", "url": "https://www.scribd.com/doc/86778173/Useful-Web-Links"}]}, "The search didn't turn up anything about Hema Budaraju or a \"More ways to connect with the web from Search\" article. The results were unrelated: school textbook chapters on the internet and web browsers, a 2004 Google seminar by Krishna Bharat, a university lecture on the Internet, an NPR segment on social networking sites, and a few other pages.\n\nThe exact-phrase query may be too narrow for the index. A search for Hema Budaraju alone, or for the title without her name, might work better."], "durationSeconds": 3.3316495409999987, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01NHqcKoSdVLiMWvSFE8M3cB", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
