{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_019kmAT9gZyEW7r3n9tkneLQ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://betanews.com/article/google-ai-mode-inline-links-higher-click-data/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.relevantaudience.com/geo/google-inline-links-higher-ai-mode-ai-overviews/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ppc.land/google-pushes-links-higher-in-ai-answers-as-preferred-sources-use-rises-7x/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AI_Overviews\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instant_answer\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.analyticsinsight.net/news/google-search-updates-ai-mode-ai-overviews-with-more-prominent-links\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.newsbytesapp.com/news/science/google-updates-ai-mode-and-ai-overviews-to-surface-links/tldr\"}, {\"url\": \"https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/updates-ai-mode-overviews-explore-web/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_AI_Mode\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:20:03.778Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Google AI Mode AI Overviews inline links source context update October 15 2026 Hema Budaraju", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01XF4pdcYN3DGsTDHDi5YDN6", "content": [{"title": "Google moves inline links higher in AI Mode and AI Overviews", "url": "https://betanews.com/article/google-ai-mode-inline-links-higher-click-data/"}, {"title": "Google moves AI Mode inline links higher", "url": "https://www.relevantaudience.com/geo/google-inline-links-higher-ai-mode-ai-overviews/"}, {"title": "Google pushes links higher in AI answers as Preferred Sources use rises 7x", "url": "https://ppc.land/google-pushes-links-higher-in-ai-answers-as-preferred-sources-use-rises-7x/"}, {"title": "AI Overviews", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AI_Overviews"}, {"title": "Instant answer", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Instant_answer"}, {"title": "Google Search Updates AI Mode, AI Overviews with More Prominent Links", "url": "https://www.analyticsinsight.net/news/google-search-updates-ai-mode-ai-overviews-with-more-prominent-links"}, {"title": "Google updates AI mode and AI overviews to surface links", "url": "https://www.newsbytesapp.com/news/science/google-updates-ai-mode-and-ai-overviews-to-surface-links/tldr"}, {"title": "AI Mode and AI Overviews updates to explore the web", "url": "https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/search/updates-ai-mode-overviews-explore-web/"}, {"title": "Google AI Mode", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_AI_Mode"}]}, "Google announced the update on October 15, 2026, in a Keyword post by Hema Budaraju, its VP of Product Management. The post is titled \"More ways to connect with the web from Search,\" and it covers AI Mode and AI Overviews.\n\n- **Inline links:** Google says it has increased inline links in its AI experiences and is now showing them higher in responses more often ([8-16, 8-17](#)). Coverage describes the change as a move higher up the page, with the end-of-response links also redesigned ([7-3](#)).\n- **Source context:** The headline update mentions clearer inline links and context about sources ([8-1](#)). One outlet says the test section for official sites will explain why each suggested page may be useful ([6-10](#)).\n- **Official pages test:** Google is testing a dedicated section at the top of some answers for official sites. Coverage says it has no set timing ([2-4](#)).\n- **News carousels and creators:** Timely-article carousels are rolling out to more locations and languages, and creator names on AI Mode video results are being tested as clickable links ([2-4, 2-5](#)).\n- **Preferred Sources:** Google says use of this feature has grown more than sevenfold since the start of 2026, though it gave no baseline ([3-3](#)).\n- **Click data:** Search Console still shows no click data for AI results. Google told Search Engine 